# Optional: Google Maps Tiles API key for the geo-context (Photorealistic 3D Tiles) feature.
# You can also just paste the key into the in-app "Real-world context" panel instead.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in your key.
#
# The key needs the "Map Tiles API" enabled in Google Cloud, and Google bills per session.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
